  "description_short": "Laid-back Piesang Valley café serving hearty breakfasts, fresh sandwiches, and excellent coffee with a welcoming vibe.",
  "description_long": "Tucked along Piesang Valley Road, Roadside Café has earned its reputation as a local favourite where surfers, families, and travellers stop for proper fuel. The menu leans into generous breakfast plates, fresh salads, and satisfying sandwiches made with quality ingredients — nothing fancy, just done well.\n\nThe coffee is reliably good, the service warm and efficient, and the atmosphere strikes that easy balance between casual and care. Inside feels comfortably unpretentious, while outdoor seating lets you soak up the Garden Route sunshine. It's the kind of place that delivers what you came for without overthinking it.\n\nWhether you're heading to the beach or just need a solid meal in Plett, Roadside Café does the job with heart and consistency.",
